---
layout: app-layout.njk
title: Grade Scales & Conversion – Climbing Logbook
discipline: true
bundle: performance-grades
staticShellNote: |-
  Genuinely static shell (#348, #705), same pattern as public/
         performance/trends/index.html -- see that file's own comment for
         why every path below is absolute and client/performance-grades-
         main.js reads the username from location.pathname itself rather
         than this file being templated. Unlike the other 5 report pages,
         this one has no offline fallback and no #time-window-root: it
         reads only #702's already-committed conversion data
         (shared/grade-data.js), never a live API.
---
<div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
  <!-- Picker/menu row before the brand row, and align-left on
       <climbing-header> -- matches /logbook's own layout (left-aligned
       brand row below the header row, not centered above it). Found via
       Raven's production report, 2026-08-10 -- see climbing-header.js's
       own comment on the align-left attribute. -->
  <climbing-page-header></climbing-page-header>

  <div class="flex items-end gap-3 mb-5" id="picker-tabs-row">
    <climbing-discipline-picker></climbing-discipline-picker>
    <climbing-tab-bar active-page="performance"></climbing-tab-bar>
  </div>

  <!-- #601 -- same btn back-link pattern as every other report page;
       href set client-side in client/performance-grades-main.js once
       USERNAME is known. -->
  <a class="btn btn-primary mt-4 mb-5" id="back-to-performance-link" href="#">
    <svg class="w-[.9rem] h-[.9rem] stroke-current fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>
    Performance Insights
  </a>

  <div class="mb-5" id="view-explainer">
    <p class="text-[.95rem] text-foreground leading-[1.7]">How this discipline's own grade scales line up against each other, and where every equivalence in this app comes from.</p>
  </div>

  <div id="grade-scale-matrix-root"></div>

  <div class="text-center text-muted text-[.78rem] mt-8" id="footer"></div>
</div>
